 /sys/class/backlight/osprey-backlight brightness 0660 system system
+/dev/media* 0660 cameraserver camera
+/dev/v4l-subdev* 0660 cameraserver camera
+/sys/class/leds/osprey:flash brightness 0660 cameraserver camera
+/sys/class/leds/osprey:flash flash_strobe 0660 cameraserver camera
+/dev/dma_heap/system 0664 system camera
